      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay, a week seems like a long time to wait. the swelling is pretty noticeable compared to my other leg, but i'm mostly just worried about the cost of an urgent care visit. since it's probably just a strain, can i just take some more ibuprofen to get the swelling down faster? like, how much can i safely take if i really need to get this under control tonight?",
